<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Launcher background: the Midnight Shop's ground, with the lamp pooling from above right.

    Darker than it was. The old ground ran #2E2418 in the lit corner down to #17120F, which
    put a mid-brown directly behind a cream disc — the two were close enough in value that the
    mark's silhouette went soft on a busy wallpaper. The pool is still there and still comes
    from the same corner as the room's key light, but it now sits nearer the black end so the
    disc cuts out of it.

    DESIGN.md's crateBlack (#17120F) is the floor rather than the ceiling here; nothing goes
    to pure black, which the palette rules out.

    Adaptive icons are masked to as little as the centre 66%, so nothing here may carry
    meaning: this is ground only, and the disc on the foreground layer does the work.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <path
        android:pathData="M0,0h108v108h-108z"
        android:fillColor="#12100D" />

    <!-- The lamp's pool, from up and to the right, matching RoomLighting.KEY_POSITION. -->
    <path android:pathData="M0,0h108v108h-108z">
        <aapt:attr xmlns:aapt="http://schemas.android.com/aapt" name="android:fillColor">
            <gradient
                android:type="radial"
                android:centerX="76"
                android:centerY="28"
                android:gradientRadius="86">
                <item android:offset="0.0" android:color="#231A12" />
                <item android:offset="0.5" android:color="#171310" />
                <item android:offset="1.0" android:color="#100E0C" />
            </gradient>
        </aapt:attr>
    </path>
</vector>
